    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.2",
      "title": "Eye bars description",
      "body": "Eye bars can be:\n\n● Externally Riveted Eye Bars This type of eye bar is documented by historical sources. It consists of metal plates riveted externally.\n● Buhurt “Optimized” Eye Bars This type of eye bar is not documented by historical sources. It consists of metal plates riveted or welded to the inside of a helmet.",
