    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.3",
      "title": "General requirements",
      "body": "All types of eye bars must respect the following requirements\n\n● Be firmly attached to prevent any breakage and maintain a high level of protection in any situation.\n● Protect the whole eye slot from top to bottom.\n\nRecommended: Eye slots should not exceed an opening of 25 mm",
