      "ordinal": 7,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "2.1",
      "title": "Historical Sources and Dating",
      "body": "A few historical sources display this type of eye bar.\nThe main source is the Great Helm from Nuremberg (1350).\n\nDespite its rarity, it is approved for 14th-century, transitional, and 15th-century armors.",
