    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "2.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "● Externally riveted eye bars must conform with the general requirements (1.3)\n● Externally riveted eye bars must be firmly riveted to the outside of the eye slot.\n● Externally riveted eye bars must resemble the historical sources and not exceed a width of 30mm.\n● Externally riveted eye bars must be made of metal.",
